{"role":"user","content":"Find data from the 2011 Bulgarian census about gender and tertiary education.\n\nI need: the number of men and women in Bulgaria who completed tertiary education according to the 2011 census.\n\nPlease search using websearch and webfetch. The tools may work intermittently. Try many times with different queries:\n\n1. \"Bulgaria 2011 census education gender tertiary\"\n2. \"2011 Bulgarian census higher education men women\"\n3. Try fetching https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2011_Bulgarian_census with prompt about tertiary education\n4. Try fetching https://www.nsi.bg/en/census2011 about education by sex\n5. Try \"Bulgaria census 2011 educational attainment by sex\"\n6. Try Eurostat data on Bulgaria tertiary education 2011\n\nThe final answer I need is the difference (subtract smaller from larger) between men and women with tertiary education, expressed in thousands.\n\nReport back the exact numbers you find."}
